    # ri "First off, you should mellow out for a few hours until the drugs wear off."
    ri "首先，你得冷静一下，等药效过了再说。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1716
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_40d289b5:

    # ri "After that, if you're still feeling like this, come talk to me about it again and I'll help you deal with it."
    ri "之后如果你还是这样感觉，再来找我，我会帮你处理的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1718
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_5c39f52f:

    # ri "Let me just say that you don't need body hair to be a man, [name]."
    ri "你不需要体毛才能成为男人，[name]."

