# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1732
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_6ee6f1fb:

    # mc "Yeah, it's me. I thought I saw you take off. You're not leaving already, right?"
    mc "是我。我刚才好像看见你离开了。你不会已经要走了吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1734
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_583cae00:

    # ri "No, I needed a break from the party. It's too noisy for me, right now."
    ri "不，我需要从派对里抽离一下。现在太吵了，我受不了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1735
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_a4d5f42a:

    # ri "It felt good to get some space and enjoy this place by myself for a little bit."
    ri "感觉能有点空间，一个人待着享受这里的感觉真不错。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1737
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_1721fce7:

    # mc "It is loud and crazy over there, yeah."
    mc "那边吵吵闹闹的，挺疯狂的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1738
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_fbb47136:

    # mc "I'm glad people are having fun, but I'm not so sure about the drugs they're taking."
    mc "我很高兴大家玩得开心，但对他们在用的那些药我可不太确定。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1740
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_33f38bd0:

    # ri "Mushrooms aren't that bad, but it kinda depends on what mood you're in when you're taking them."
    ri "蘑菇不一定是坏事，但很大程度上取决于你吃的时候心情怎么样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1741
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_07b5b2c5:

    # ri "If you see someone having a bad trip and hallucinating, there's not much you can do but to try and calm them down until it wears off."
    ri "如果你看到有人嗑药出问题，幻觉严重，你也没啥办法，只能尽量安抚他们，等药效过了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1743
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_f15b78f1:

    # mc "It sounds like you've got experience with it."
    mc "听起来你倒是挺有经验的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1745
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_87d98211:

    # ri "I've tried it many times, so yeah. It's nice, but I had some bad nights with it too."
    ri "我试过很多次。挺不错的，不过也有过几次糟糕的经历。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1746
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_92adc7ad:

    # ri "Once, I thought I was locked inside of a big shoe box and couldn't get out."
    ri "有一次，我感觉自己被困在一个巨大的鞋盒里，出不去了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1747
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_0a882d6e:

    # ri "What really happened was that Quinn locked us inside of her room when we took the shrooms, so we didn't go wander off when we were high."
    ri "真正发生的是Quinn把我们锁在她房间里，我们嗑了药之后就没出去晃荡了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1750
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_d87f833c:

    # mc "That sounds scary. I'm happy I passed on it."
    mc "听起来挺吓人的。我庆幸自己没尝试。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1752
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_e94e494e:

    # mc "That doesn't sound fun at all. I don't get why people do drugs like that."
    mc "这听起来一点都不好玩。我真搞不懂人们干嘛要干这种事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1755
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_44c1a0cf:

    # ri "Yeah, if it's your first time, I wouldn't do it out here."
    ri "嗯，如果你是第一次尝试，我建议别在这儿搞。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1757
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_ca1d1b00:

    # ri "It's fun experimenting. You drink alcohol, don't you? This is just another way of warping your senses. It's fun."
    ri "玩这些玩意儿挺有意思的。你不是也喝点酒吗？这不过是另一种扭曲感官的方式，挺好玩的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1759
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_0aeb6a27:

    # mc "Anyway... Help me keep an eye out for them tonight. I don't want anything to happen to them."
    mc "总之，今晚帮我盯着点他们。我不想他们出什么岔子。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1761
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_423e1880:

    # ri "They're in good company, but sure."
    ri "他们待的地方不错，不过行吧。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1763
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_90908c7c:

    # ri "Hey... Since when do you grow a beard?"
    ri "嘿……你什么时候开始留胡子的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1765
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_6c6d85dc:

    # mc "I'm trying something new. Do you like it?"
    mc "我在尝试一些新东西，你喜欢吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1767
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_3fa2afe7:

    # ri "It looks weird on you. Maybe I'll get used to it, but I like you better clean-shaven. Sorry..."
    ri "看起来你长胡子的样子有点奇怪。也许我过段时间会习惯，但我还是更喜欢你刮干净的样子。抱歉..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1769
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_8ec3db3a:

    # mc "Thank you. I do too."
    mc "谢谢。我也一样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1771
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_cc33e2e5:

    # ri "Then why are you growing it?"
    ri "那为什么你要留胡子？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1773
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_8798726c:

    # mc "No reason."
    mc "没什么理由。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1775
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_cfc89422:

    # ri "This doesn't have anything to do with those posters, does it?"
    ri "这和那些海报有什么关系？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1777
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_6819f35b:

    # mc "How did you know? You just saw through me."
    mc "你怎么知道的？你根本看穿我了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1779
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_0b95cb65:

    # ri "Because it isn't you. And your brothers told me you were among the few who didn't get affected by the pictures."
    ri "因为那不是你。还有你的兄弟告诉我，你是在少数没被那些照片影响的人之一。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1780
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_d3051206:

    # ri "I guess that made me open my eyes more to see if that was the case or if you were hiding some of the pain."
    ri "我想这让我更加清醒地看清楚，那是不是真的，或者你是不是在隐藏一些痛苦。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1782
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_2ab6f2d5:

    # mc "They aren't completely wrong. I'm lucky they didn't write my name on it and that my face was concealed."
    mc "他们说得没错。他们没在我名字上写我的名字，而且我的脸也被遮住了，我运气不错。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1783
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_475906de:

    # mc "But somehow those words they wrote cut deeper than I thought they would."
    mc "但不知为何，那些话写出来后比我想象中更伤人。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1785
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_1c60ad7d:

    # mc "I don't get a lot of body hair, and the little I get I shave."
    mc "我没多少体毛，有的话我都会剃掉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1786
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_5bf26799:

    # mc "I guess those words made me overanalyze if that's a bad thing in people's minds or not. I only thought it was me who had a problem with it."
    mc "我想那些话让我开始过度思考，别人心里是不是觉得这有什么不好的地方。我只以为是自己有问题。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1788
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_df92e593:

    # ri "You don't need body hair to be a man, [name]."
    ri "你不需要体毛才能成为男人[name]."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1789
