    # ri "When I looked at that picture of you in the poster, do you know what I saw?"
    ri "当我看到那张你出现在海报上的照片时，你知道我看到了什么吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1791
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_933113dc:

    # ri "I saw a poor attempt at body shaming someone who shouldn't feel any shame."
    ri "我看到的是有人试图用身体羞辱来贬低一个本就不该感到羞耻的人。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1792
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_53206aa7_1:

