    ri "你就是这样的，很好。[name]别让它影响到你。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1797
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_0c24b0d9_1:

    # ri "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    ri "*{i}亲吻{/i}*"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1803
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_90e8231b:

    # mc "Thanks, Rio..."
    mc "谢谢，里奥娜..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1804
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_3f373461:

    # mc "I realize I look stupid with the beard, but I wanted to give it a try."
    mc "我承认长着胡子看起来挺傻，但我想试试看。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1805
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_92cb86ad:

    # mc "The next time I do it, it won't be for these reasons."
    mc "下次我这么做，可不是为了这些理由。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1807
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_45080704:

    # ri "I haven't been able to stop thinking about the arcade since we went there."
    ri "从我们去完电玩城之后，我脑子里就一直想着那地方。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1810
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_e8a2fcea:

    # mc "Oh! The arcade! Yes! That was such a great time!"
    mc "哦！那个电玩城！对啊！那真是棒极了！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1812
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_b3c9ad3a:

    # mc "Me neither! I had so much fun."
    mc "我也是！玩得太开心了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1814
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_f7130791:

    # ri "Honestly, I can't remember when I had that much fun."
    ri "说实话，我真记不清上次这么开心是什么时候了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1815
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_2e0942ca:

    # ri "When are we doing it again?"
    ri "我们什么时候再去一次？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1817
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_4aae73d2:

    # mc "Oh, definitely sometime soon. I just need to stock up on quarters before we go."
    mc "哦，我们很快肯定还会再去。我只需要先攒够下次用的硬币。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1819
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_62b610c3:

    # ri "It can get expensive if you do it like we did it every time."
    ri "玩这么多次的话，钱可就花得不少了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1821
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_c43cae23:

    # mc "It was a great date."
    mc "这是一次很棒的约会。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1823
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_9755bb12:

    # ri "Did I bum you out when I left without doing stuff to you?"
    ri "我离开的时候没跟你玩够，让你不爽了吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1825
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你是什么意思？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1827
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_d56bf4ae:

    # ri "Like, were you expecting me to blow you after or something?"
    ri "你是不是指望我之后直接上你？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1829
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_b1674a63:

    # mc "What!? Not at all. Where did you come up with that?"
    mc "什么？完全不是那么回事。你哪儿听来的这种想法？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1831
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_0f580f02:

    # ri "So, you just wanted to hang out with me and do whatever I wanted to do?"
    ri "所以你就是想和我一起玩，做我想做的那些事？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1833
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_5c29f942:

    # mc "That's why I tagged along."
    mc "这就是我跟着你的原因。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1835
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_7e331f1f:

    # ri "I kept telling myself that's what it was, too. That you wanted to hang out with me."
    ri "我也一直告诉自己是这样，我也以为你是想和我一起玩乐。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1836
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_a40883a3:

    # ri "But after I came back home, I was unsure and thought that couldn't possibly be it."
    ri "可回家之后，我又不确定了，觉得事情不可能仅仅如此。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1837
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_5a2c3410:

    # ri "How fucked up am I, [name]?"
    ri "[name]，我到底有多不正常？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1839
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_931fe269:

    # mc "That's what it was. Everything doesn't have to be about sex."
    mc "这就是真相。事情不一定要和性有关。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1840
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_797bab9d:

    # mc "Just because I want to sleep with you doesn't mean I don't want to hang out with you too."
    mc "我只是想和你上床，并不意味着我不想和你一起出去玩。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1843
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_e548cfa9:

    # ri "That's not the shrooms talking, right?"
    ri "那不是幻觉，对吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1845
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_db149c7a:

    # mc "No, it's not. It's me."
    mc "不是，是我。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1849
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_0c24b0d9_2:

    # ri "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    ri "*{i}亲吻{/i}*"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1851
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_3ed56555:

    # ri "But what if I want the sex too?"
    ri "但要是我也想要那方面的呢？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1852
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_ff4758a6:

    # ri "Like, if I acknowledge that it's not the reason you'd be spending time with me, but still want it. That's not fucked up, is it?"
    ri "比如，就算我承认你跟我花时间不是因为这个，但还是想要。这不奇怪，对吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:1854
translate schinese ep10_bbq_rio_event_label_bdcfa028:

