translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_4e2d7f49:

    # ji "Your friends have been acting weird all night."
    ji "你那些朋友今晚一直表现得很奇怪。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2785
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_dc65f641:

    # mc "Yeah, I know. But they'll come to their senses soon enough. I think the effect of the drugs is wearing off."
    mc "是的，我知道。但他们很快就会清醒过来。我想毒品的效果已经慢慢消退了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2787
