    mc "希望这次不会像去年那么糟糕。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2804
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_54ab2edd:

    # ji "You never know..."
    ji "你永远不知道..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2805
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_12620e3f:

    # mc "And then spring is around the corner, and before we know it, it's hot again."
    mc "然后春天到来，转眼又变热了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2807
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_9458c62b:

    # ji "Yeah. What are you looking forward to the most? Winter or Spring?"
    ji "嗯。你更期待哪个季节，冬天还是春天？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2809
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_a7f43402:

    # mc "Spring. Hands down."
    mc "春天。毫无疑问。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2811
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_e2dbc4bb:

    # ji "Oh, that's right. You hate winter."
    ji "哦，对了，你可真是讨厌冬天。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2813
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_add3c34c:

    # mc "Compared to spring and summer, yeah."
    mc "跟春天和夏天比起来，是的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2814
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_9bfb8c33:

    # mc "I'm looking forward to spring and spring break. I've heard some fun things about it."
    mc "我最期待的就是春天和春假，我听说这段时间挺有意思的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2815
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_a6adb14d:

    # mc "And I take it you're the other way around, since you hate spring break."
    mc "而且我猜你也是相反的，毕竟你讨厌春假。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2817
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_af07fdbf:

    # ji "I don't hate spring break, I just don't do it the way everyone else does."
    ji "我不讨厌春假，我只是不按大家的方式去玩。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2818
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_30dae37d:

    # ji "And I do look forward to winter. I'm hoping you'll change your mind about it."
    ji "而且我其实还挺期待冬天的。希望你能改变对它的看法。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2819
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_92a389a1:

    # ji "Because I bet I can make you see that it's more fun than you think it is."
    ji "因为我打赌我能让你明白，其实它比你想象的要好玩得多。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2821
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_1c26375a:

    # mc "I'm not sure you can, but we can make a deal if you want."
    mc "我不确定你能不能做到，但如果你想的话，我们可以做个交易。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2823
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_fee84f5a:

    # ji "What kind of a deal?"
    ji "什么类型的交易？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2825
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_9cfa72ca:

    # mc "If I try to come around on winter stuff, you try to come around on spring break."
    mc "如果我试着接受冬天的事，你就好好去玩春假。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2827
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_d6fb9aa8:

    # ji "Haha, why?"
    ji "哈哈，为啥？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2829
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_242292e4:

    # mc "The same reason you told me. I bet I can make you see that it's more fun than you think it is."
    mc "和你之前说的一样。我打赌我能让你明白，其实比你想象的要好玩得多。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2833
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_2e07947f:

