# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2851
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_8002d575:

    # ji "You're pushing all the right buttons now, aren't you?"
    ji "你正按着正确的按钮呢，不是吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2853
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_3144a4ef:

    # mc "I can see it in your eyes. I know you want to like it."
    mc "我能从你眼里看出来，我知道你很想喜欢它。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2855
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_96f85c20:

    # ji "The last time I heard it was when I was young, and back then it didn't sound much like music to me."
    ji "上一次我听到这个是小时候，那时候听起来一点都不像音乐。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2856
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_4fcc8860:

    # ji "They were kind of screaming and played fast and aggressive."
    ji "他们唱得挺狂野，节奏也很快，挺激烈的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2858
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_03932df6:

    # mc "You're musically gifted. I'm sure if you listened to the melodies of the instruments and vocals you will hear what I hear."
    mc "你有音乐天赋。我相信如果你仔细听乐器和人声的旋律，你也会听到我听到的东西。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2860
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_e221c147:

    # ji "Ok. I'll be open-minded then. You're welcome to change my mind."
    ji "好，我保持开放心态。你随时可以改变我的想法。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2862
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_167f73b8:

