translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_afcdb16a:

    # mc "Ok. This is one of my favorites. Make sure you really listen to it."
    mc "好，这是我最喜欢的歌之一。你可得认真听。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2873
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_bbe672be:

    # mc "Try to love it, ok?"
    mc "试着喜欢它，好吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2876
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_6aaffc26:

    # ji "I will try."
    ji "我会试试。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2885
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_afd74152:

    # mc "What do you think?"
    mc "你觉得怎么样？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2887
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_4eb835da:

    # ji "Did my sister listen to this?"
    ji "我妹妹听了吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2889
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_153dfd57:

    # mc "It's from the album of her poster, so odds are she did."
    mc "这是她海报专辑里的歌，所以她大概率听了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2891
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_78a17f19:

    # ji "It's different than I remember. It's...aggressive, but still catchy."
    ji "和我记忆里不一样。它……有点攻击性，但还是挺抓耳的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2892
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_80983bc0:

    # ji "And you're right, there are some melodies in there."
    ji "你说得对，里面确实有些旋律。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2894
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_b3ddafbf:

    # ji "Hahaha, this is so Lana."
    ji "哈哈哈，这太有Lana的风格了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2896
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_c92dcb32:

    # mc "Sometimes it takes a while to get into it, but keep listening to it and it will grow on you."
    mc "有时候需要一点时间才能入坑，但继续听下去，它会慢慢让你上头。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2897
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_0946e342:

    # mc "That's how I started with some bands that I didn't think I would like. And eventually, I became a fan of them."
    mc "这就是我开始喜欢一些原本以为不会喜欢的乐队的方式。最后我竟然成了他们的粉丝。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2898
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_7f8df92d:

    # mc "I know it's different than the classical music you enjoy, but maybe you would love this music if you start listening more to it."
    mc "我知道它和你喜欢的古典音乐不一样，但也许如果你多听几遍，你会爱上这种音乐。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2900
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_60a3dda4:

    # ji "Not everything has to be Chopin."
    ji "不一定要都是肖邦。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2901
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_51804d43:

    # ji "Thank you for showing me. I think I will have to give it a proper listening to another day."
    ji "谢谢你的介绍。我得找个时间好好听听。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:2903
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jill2_event_label_154ba8ad:

