    # ji "It was an impulse. I was so mad! All the lies and then he's doing that from across the hall."
    ji "是冲动之举。我当时气疯了！一堆谎言，然后他就在隔壁楼干那事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3752
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_206a8eab:

    # ji "I felt disgusted and humiliated!"
    ji "我感到恶心又丢脸！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3757
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_8519c550:

    # ji "I left and he had a heated argument with Trent."
    ji "我离开后，他和Trent吵得不可开交。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3758
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_72d96205:

    # ji "After which Trent came to me and told me he's on my side, if we bring this up to the disciplinary committee."
    ji "之后Trent来找我，说他站在我们这边，如果我们把这事告到纪律委员会去的话。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3763
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_a3b643d1:

    # mc "What would happen if you did?"
    mc "那你会怎么做？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3768
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_cdd9f546:

    # ji "Tybalt would likely be removed as President. His entire world would shatter."
    ji "主角的名字可能会被开除当总统，他整个世界都会崩塌。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3776
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_e949cba3:

    # mc "Oh, hell yes! Do that. Let's get rid of him."
    mc "哦，他妈的，干就完事了！把他搞掉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3781
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_9fb987a5:

    # ji "It is tempting, but I don't want to ruin him. I just want him to leave me alone and stop trying to provoke me."
    ji "这挺诱人的，但我可不想毁了他。我只想让他别再纠缠我，别再故意挑衅我。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3786
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_f63de8df:

    # mc "Whoa... I wouldn't want my world to shatter. Into like a million pieces..."
    mc "哇……我可不想我的世界碎掉。碎成一地渣渣……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3787
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_0edb79d8:

    # mc "Don't do it, Jill. Show him mercy."
    mc "别这么做，Jill。饶他一回吧。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3789
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_672a802e:

    # mc "I don't like the guy and he's a fucking creep for doing that, on top of everything else he does..."
    mc "我不喜欢这家伙，他干这种事就他妈的够恶心了，再加上他其他那些事……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3790
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_cbec9d82:

    # mc "...but you should show him some mercy. Don't you think?"
    mc "但你该给他点怜悯。你不会觉得吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3791
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_0dcea604:

    # mc "You're better than him."
    mc "你比他强。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3796
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_fe48d242:

    # ji "That's what I'm leaning toward. I don't want to ruin him. I just want him to leave me alone and stop trying to provoke me."
    ji "这就是我倾向的做法。我不想毁了他，我只是想让他别再纠缠我，别再故意挑衅我。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3798
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_563a44ad:

    # ji "Trent told me Tybalt's feeling upset about what happened, so I think it will have an effect without me telling the committee about it."
    ji "Trent跟我说Tybalt对刚才的事很不爽，所以我觉得不用我去找委员会说，这事本身就会有影响。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3799
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_3e15e4d4:

    # ji "But we'll see... I haven't ruled it out yet, and I don't want to talk to him about it because I'm still mad."
    ji "但咱们走着瞧……我还没完全放弃这个想法，而且我现在还气着他，不想跟他谈这个。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3804
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_16bdd35b:

    # ji "Anyway... I'm sorry for doubting you."
    ji "总之...我为怀疑你感到抱歉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3809
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_b99ef3d2:

    # mc "I understand why you did... I crossed a line with what I did. I'm sorry too."
    mc "我明白你为什么那样做……我越界了，对不起。我也很抱歉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3810
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_af8e42d8:

    # mc "Are we...cool?"
    mc "我们...还能做朋友吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3815
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_66492728:

    # ji "We're good, [name]."
    ji "我们没事。[name]."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3817
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_7622c460:

    # ji "Tomorrow's Thanksgiving and these last years I've spent it with Bella."
    ji "明天就是感恩节了，这几年我都和贝拉一起过的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3818
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_a3115c60:

    # ji "Thinking about it being different this year has been weighing me down a lot."
    ji "想到今年会不一样，这件事一直压在我心里，让我很沉重。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3819
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_ad896606:

    # ji "I've decided to talk to her again."
    ji "我决定再跟她谈谈。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3824
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_8d66b338:

    # mc "That makes me happy to hear."
    mc "这让我很高兴听到。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3829
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_af614375:

    # ji "I'm not promising anything, but..."
    ji "我可没说一定行，但……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3834
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_dec40cd7:

    # mc "I understand. And still, I appreciate it."
    mc "我明白。不过，我还是很感激。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3840
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_374fe717:

    # sa "Jill! Finally! We've been waiting for you."
    sa "Jill！你终于来了！我们一直在等你。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3844
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_483bb62d:

    # mc "Sage... I get it now. It's an herb!"
    mc "Sage……我明白了，这是种草药！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3847
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_85470e1a:

    # sa "Pull yourself together, cutie. Drugs are bad for you, ok?"
    sa "收住点，小可爱。毒品对你不好，知道吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3849
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_3aac99a7:

    # sa "Pull yourself together, [name]. Drugs are bad for you, ok?"
    sa "收住你的思绪[name]毒品对你不好，好吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3854
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_f95629d9:

    # ji "Drugs?"
    ji "药物？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3856
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_ee5aa106:

    # sa "The boys ate mushrooms. They're out here tripping all over the place."
    sa "男生们吃了蘑菇，现在全都晕乎乎的，到处乱撞。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3859
translate schinese ep10_bbq_jillvar_event_label_af8aa488:

    # sa "Come! It's drinks and girl talk time."
    sa "来吧，该喝点东西，聊聊女孩的事了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3899
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7bcedc4c:

    # zo "Seriously... How are you tonight?"
    zo "说真的……你今晚怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3901
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_f143ea15:

    # mc "I made a mistake."
    mc "我犯了一个错。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3903
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_2c4f350f:

    # zo "Was it the drugs? It doesn't look like you're enjoying yourself."
    zo "是药效吗？你看起来一点都不开心。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3905
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_924f89e9:

    # mc "I'm seeing things, Zoey."
    mc "我出现幻觉了，Zoey。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3908
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_8176e700:

    # zo "Let's get away for a while. Talk to me, and I'll help you snap out of it."
    zo "我们找个地方躲一会儿。跟我说说话，我帮你摆脱这种状态。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3911
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_3e8c45e5:

    # zo "How are you tonight?"
    zo "今晚怎么样？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3913
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_f0a5ec2e:

    # mc "Aside from having to babysit my brothers, I'm having fun. What about you?"
    mc "除了得照看我的兄弟们，我玩得很开心。你呢？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3916
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_77d50ff6:

    # zo "Yeah, me too. Can we go somewhere and talk?"
    zo "嗯，我也这么想。我们找个地方聊聊吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3922
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_97dc64fa:

    # zo "I wasn't sure if I should have come here."
    zo "我不确定自己是不是该来这儿。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3923
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_65d0fd19:

    # zo "It felt weird getting an invite from the DIKs when it wasn't from you."
    zo "从DIKs那儿收到邀请感觉怪怪的，本来应该是你请我的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3925
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7c8c6992:

    # mc "I heard that Tommy invited you, and by then I didn't think it mattered if I did it too."
    mc "我听说是Tommy邀请的你，那时候我就想，反正我也来呗。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3927
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_5b8097ee:

    # zo "But are you cool with me being here? Hanging with your friends and all."
    zo "但你介意我在这里吗？和你的朋友们一起待着。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3929
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_5cae39df:

    # mc "I don't control you, Zoey. You can be friends with whoever you want to be friends with."
    mc "我不会控制你，Zoey。你想和谁做朋友都可以。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3931
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_8d1ff106:

    # zo "A part of me feels like I'm pushing myself back into your life when you're not sure you want me in it."
    zo "我有一部分感觉，像是在把你重新拉回我的生活里，而你却还不确定是否真的想让我留下。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3932
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_27fb9665:

    # zo "I hate that feeling."
    zo "我讨厌这种感觉。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3934
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_68c459f3:

    # mc "I never said I didn't want you in my life... But I have a hard time forgiving you."
    mc "我从来没说过我不想要你在我的生活中……但我很难原谅你。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3935
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_bf0c30b7:

    # mc "I have a hard time forgiving myself, too. I keep beating myself up over it."
    mc "我也很难原谅自己。我一直在责怪自己。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3937
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_0fa9e720:

    # zo "Forgive yourself for what?"
    zo "原谅自己为了什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3939
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_df07b5ec:

    # mc "I think I wouldn't feel this bummed out and angry if I never lied to you about how I felt in the first place."
    mc "我想如果一开始就没对你撒谎，就不会现在这么沮丧和生气了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3940
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_106cc82e:

    # mc "Maybe it would have been easier to say how I felt instead of pretending things were fine?"
    mc "也许早点说出来，而不是假装一切都没事，会容易些？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3941
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7d75ac34:

    # mc "And now that I thought I had moved on, seeing you brings those feelings back. That's why I get mad."
    mc "现在我觉得自己已经放下了，可一见到你那些情绪又回来了。这就是我为什么会生气。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3944
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_71b3f5d0:

    # zo "Thanks for the invite. I didn't realize you guys were re-enacting a college horror movie in the woods."
    zo "谢谢邀请。我没想到你们几个在树林里演个大学恐怖片。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3945
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_b0fd1b07:

    # zo "I would have brought popcorn if I knew."
    zo "我本来会带爆米花来的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3947
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_9c4e78f9:

    # mc "There are marshmallows if you want them."
    mc "这里有棉花糖，要吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3949
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_99421028:

    # zo "I'll pass. Those are too sugary."
    zo "我就不吃了。那些东西太甜了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3951
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_14062506:

    # zo "About last time... When I left, it kinda felt like a weird tension in the air between us."
    zo "关于上次的事……我离开的时候，感觉我们之间好像有种奇怪的紧张气氛。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3953
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_1357f04e:

    # zo "You started getting sentimental and I felt I could have handled it better."
    zo "你开始变得感性，我当时觉得自己应该处理得更好。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3955
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_b0807f40:

    # zo "I should have let you get sentimental. But I didn't wanna feel those feelings at the time."
    zo "我当时应该让你表达感情的。但我那时候不想去感受那些情绪。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3956
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_289a023a:

    # zo "Instead, I went into panic mode and tried to keep it cool."
    zo "相反，我直接慌了，试图保持镇定。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3958
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7502dc42:

    # mc "Yeah, I know."
    mc "嗯，我知道。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3960
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_0b9dff27:

    # zo "But I've thought about it a lot, and even though it's probably gonna hurt again..."
    zo "但我已经想了很多，虽然这次可能还是会痛..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3961
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_84732e83:

    # zo "I'm ready to talk about it more, if you are."
    zo "我准备多聊聊这件事，如果你也愿意的话。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3963
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_eaa8ee47:

    # mc "About what?"
    mc "关于什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3965
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_6b89873d:

    # zo "Like...more about how you felt when I left. If there is anything left for you to say."
    zo "比如...更多关于你在我离开时的感觉。如果你还有什么想说的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3967
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_64c29562:

    # mc "Well... I get mad thinking about that moment at the station."
    mc "好吧……一想到那个站台上的时候，我就气得不行。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3968
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_166e0113:

    # mc "I have a hard time forgiving myself. I keep beating myself up over it."
    mc "我很难原谅自己，我一直责怪自己。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3970
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_0fa9e720_1:

    # zo "Forgive yourself for what?"
    zo "原谅自己为了什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3972
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_dd96a3ef:

    # mc "I think I wouldn't have felt bummed out and angry if I never lied to you about how I felt in the first place."
    mc "我想，如果一开始我就没对你撒谎，说那些感受，我可能不会这么难受和生气。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3973
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_106cc82e_1:

    # mc "Maybe it would have been easier to say how I felt instead of pretending things were fine?"
    mc "也许当时直接说出我的感受，而不是假装一切都没事，会容易些？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3976
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_5a579c6d:

    # zo "Let's go back in time together."
    zo "让我们一起回到过去。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3979
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_e6f83b03:

    # mc "I might be hallucinating tonight, but even so, I know you can't go back in time."
    mc "我可能今晚在幻觉，但就算如此，我也知道你们没法回到过去。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3981
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_629449be:

    # mc "We can't go back in time, Zoey."
    mc "我们无法回到过去，Zoey。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3983
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_647615d4:

    # zo "We can. Look. We're at the train station again and I'm about to leave."
    zo "我们能。看。我们又到了火车站，我马上就要离开了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3986
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_cdf0d07e:

    # zo "We're sitting here in silence, not saying shit because I don't know what to say and you're obviously feeling bad."
    zo "我们坐在这沉默着，什么都没说，因为我也不知道该说什么，而你明显感觉很糟。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3988
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_8250a230:

    # zo "And instead of this long moment of silence while waiting for that train, you start talking to me."
    zo "与其在这里坐这么久沉默等那趟火车，你开始跟我说话了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3989
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_8f8889db:

    # zo "And you say the things you really wanna say. The things you didn't say. The things you could have said."
    zo "你终于说出了那些你真正想说的，那些你没说出口的，那些你本可以说的话。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3993
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_fd39367f:

    # mc "Um... Ok... I'd say..."
    mc "嗯……好吧……我该说什么呢……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3994
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_9036fd4a:

    # mc "Zoey. I don't want you to leave. Don't leave me here alone."
    mc "Zoey，我不想让你走。别把我一个人丢在这里。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3996
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_f8c8c37f:

    # zo "I have to leave, [name]. I can't stay here because it's driving me crazy."
    zo "我得走了，[name]我不能待在这里了，这让我疯了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3997
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_a9be327d:

    # zo "All I think about is my grandma and the dreams I told her about. The dreams she supported me in and wanted me to fulfill."
    zo "我脑子里全是我奶奶，还有我跟她讲过的那些梦。那些她支持我、希望我实现的梦。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:3999
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_fd9b6656:

    # mc "I understand that, but if you leave me here...you take away the only good thing I have in my life aside from Dad."
    mc "我明白，但如果你离开我，你拿走了我生命中除了爸爸之外唯一值得留恋的东西。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4000
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_a8928ed2:

    # mc "You take away someone who I thought would be my future."
    mc "你抢走了我曾以为会是我的未来。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4003
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_0372604a:

    # zo "..."
    zo "..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4005
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_ce70595d:

    # zo "[name]... What are you saying?"
    zo "[name]你在说什么？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4007
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_97541c5b:

    # mc "I didn't realize it back then...what we had together."
    mc "我当时还没意识到……我们之间到底有了什么。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4008
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7cdc7403:

    # mc "And I still have a hard time to call it what it was."
    mc "我到现在还是很难说出那到底是什么关系。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4009
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_fd5fb844:

    # mc "I've been in constant denial and kept telling myself that it was just the best friendship I ever had. But I knew it was something more than that."
    mc "我一直都在否认，告诉自己那只是我经历过最美好的友情。但我知道，那不仅仅是友情。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4010
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_c7821a2d:

    # mc "You weren't just my friend. You were my girlfriend."
    mc "你不是我的朋友。你是我的女朋友。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4011
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_2a3c9453:

    # mc "And looking at you today, I know that deep down...you were my first love."
    mc "看着你现在的样子，我知道在心底……你就是我第一个爱的人。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4013
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_0372604a_1:

    # zo "..."
    zo "..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4017
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_14487c3a:

    # mc "If I had said that... Would you have stayed?"
    mc "如果我当时说出来了，你会一直留在我身边吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4019
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_0372604a_2:

    # zo "..."
    zo "..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4023
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_cfe8f615:

    # mc "You know what? Don't answer..."
    mc "你知道吗？别回答……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4026
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7625fd4e:

    # mc "This is too much for me... I gotta do something else or I'll ruin this night even further."
    mc "这对我来说太沉重了……我得做点别的，不然今晚就全毁了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4028
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_e5e361ab:

    # mc "This is too much for me... I gotta do something else or I'll ruin this night."
    mc "这对我来说太难了……我得去做点别的，不然今晚就毁了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4030
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_7068ea06:

    # mc "We shouldn't have done this tonight... You were right to cut me off last time."
    mc "我们今晚不应该做这种事...你上次阻止我是对的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4031
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z2_event_label_194b8092:

    # mc "Sorry, but this is too much for me... I gotta do something else or I'll ruin this night."
    mc "抱歉，但今晚对我来说太难了……我得去做点别的，不然今晚就彻底毁了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4049
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_1726bfb3:

    # zo "DIKs! What's up?"
    zo "DIKs！怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4051
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_8be04b29:

    # jac "Zoey!"
    jac "Zoey！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4054
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_7f61ea3c:

    # le "Everybody, calm the fuck down!"
    le "大家冷静点！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4061
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_0532b904:

    # zo "What's up with him?"
    zo "他怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4063
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_91387865:

    # rs "He ate something."
    rs "他吃了点东西。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4065
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_e8660789:

    # zo "Ok... And him?"
    zo "那他呢？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4067
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_6a5435b7:

    # jac "He...ate something too."
    jac "他 тоже 吃了点什么。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4069
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_e23a363c:

    # zo "Good thing I'm not hungry. I'd hate to trip balls in the forest."
    zo "好在我不饿，不然在森林里走两步就可能栽跟头。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4072
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_0f9bdc28:

    # zo "[name]? Hello?"
    zo "[name]？你好？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4074
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_c1fef349:

    # mc "Hi..."
    mc "嗨..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4076
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_878346c4:

    # zo "Lemme guess. You ate something."
    zo "让我猜猜，你吃东西了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4078
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_7222bac4:

    # mc "I did."
    mc "我吃了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4081
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_b2237c52:

    # zo "Hey... Good to see you. You didn't eat something too, right?"
    zo "嘿……见到你真好。你也没吃太多吧？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4083
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_0f20d8ec:

    # mc "Only a good meal."
    mc "只是一顿好饭。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4085
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_4184d388:

    # zo "What's up with the beard? I've never seen you look this scruff."
    zo "你这胡子是怎么回事？我从来没见你这么邋遢过。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4087
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_56c4c44b:

    # mc "I'm trying something new."
    mc "我在尝试一些新东西。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4089
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_af1c9913:

    # zo "I'm surprised by it. I didn't think you could grow one."
    zo "这让我有点意外。我没想到你也能长出来。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4092
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_6f408a5b:

    # mc "But I can, ok!? I can too grow body hair! A lot of it!"
    mc "但我可以的，好吗？！我也会长体毛！而且很多！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4094
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_35c8bea2:

    # zo "Hey, mellow."
    zo "嘿，放松点。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4096
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_f5a967d4:

    # jac "Don't mind him. He's not himself tonight. Have a drink with us."
    jac "别管他。他今晚不太对劲。来跟我们喝一杯吧。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4099
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_6cc3f70d:

    # mc "Yeah, well...I can."
    mc "嗯，好吧……我也可以。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4101
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_39cb4de0:

    # jac "Wanna have a drink with us?"
    jac "要来喝一杯吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4103
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_3bca6231:

    # zo "Sure, why not?"
    zo "当然，为啥不呢？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4104
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_444e3f05:

    # zo "And while we're drinking, I have some questions about those Halloween photos. They look the bomb!"
    zo "趁我们喝酒的时候，我有些问题想问你关于那些万圣节照片的事。那些照片简直了！"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4106
translate schinese ep10_bbq_z_event_label_08385f42:

    # rs "Tell me about it! Jacob and Elena did such a great job with them."
    rs "说起来真是服了！Jacob和Elena那两张照片做得太棒了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4121
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_83aad123:

    # sa "It looks like you did it again, [name]."
    sa "你又做到了。[name]."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4124
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_4a344b67:

    # mc "I swear, it was the gnome! I didn't touch the cheese."
    mc "我发誓，是那个小矮人！我根本没碰奶酪。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4126
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_3e9c625f:

    # sa "[name]... I know it's your choice, but why are you taking drugs?"
    sa "[name]...我知道这是你的选择，但你为什么吸毒？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4128
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_9d8468e1:

    # mc "I thought it would be fun, but it's not."
    mc "我以为会很有趣，但其实不是。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4130
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_f04f69c2:

    # sa "Be careful, ok? You don't have to play Simon Says with Tommy."
    sa "小心点，行吗？你不用跟Tommy玩“听从指令”游戏。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4132
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_5784432d:

    # mc "Hold me..."
    mc "抱紧我..."

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4134
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_7faf265c:

    # sa "Come here, I got you."
    sa "过来，我在这里。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4135
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_0f7e0797:

    # sa "I was talking about the party, [name]. The party is great."
    sa "我在说派对的事。[name]聚会很棒。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4137
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_b4dc3b7c:

    # mc "Oh. Thank you."
    mc "哦。谢谢。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4140
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_379fcd6e:

    # mc "You think?"
    mc "你这么想？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4142
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_4a9c4434:

    # sa "Yeah, you did great."
    sa "嗯，你干得不错。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4144
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_0bf796b4:

    # mc "Thank you, Sage."
    mc "谢谢你，Sage。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4145
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_5e71b2aa:

    # mc "How's your end of the party going?"
    mc "你那边玩得怎么样？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4147
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_2b33b684:

    # sa "Maya's having fun and that's what matters. It makes me glad."
    sa "Maya正玩得开心，这就行了。我挺高兴的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4150
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_e1fd6fab:

    # sa "I tried talking to her and Josy about you."
    sa "我试着和她还有Josy提了提你。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4152
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_d235006c:

    # mc "How did that go?"
    mc "那事怎么样了？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4154
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_8d6a454b:

    # sa "Josy doesn't hold anything against me. But boy is she feeling blue."
    sa "Josy没有怪我，不过她现在难过得要命。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4155
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_7296a430:

    # sa "I can tell that you obviously meant a great deal to her. And that makes me feel guilty."
    sa "我能感觉到你对她来说很重要。这让我感到内疚。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4157
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_b212bb7a:

    # sa "With Maya, it was easier, but again...I feel guilty."
    sa "和Maya在一起的时候，事情反而简单些，但说到底……我还是觉得内疚。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4160
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_7d75deda:

    # mc "Since I saw you talking to Jill... Um... Her too."
    mc "自从我看到你跟Jill说话……呃……她也一样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4162
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_3a519b84:

    # sa "You've gotta be kidding me."
    sa "你他妈是认真的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4163
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_2cad6f8b:

    # sa "How many have you dated!?"
    sa "你他妈到底跟多少人交往过！？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4165
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_c43e062b:

    # mc "Don't judge me, I was dating around. But I told you that I wanted to be with you."
    mc "别评判我，我当时是在到处约会。但我已经跟你说过，我想要和你在一起。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4168
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_1ddd69ab:

    # mc "I'm sorry... I was dating around. But I told you that I wanted to be with you."
    mc "对不起……我当时确实在和不同的人约会，但我告诉过你，我想和你在一起。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4170
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_caccff1a:

    # sa "I'll make it work somehow, but I can't fight your battle with Josy for you."
    sa "我会想办法让一切顺利，但我不能替你跟Josy打架。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4172
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_3b9435b5:

    # mc "I know. I'm not asking you to. I need to find a way to make her forgive me."
    mc "我知道。我没让你替我求情。我得想办法让她原谅我。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4173
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_6ebdfa6c:

    # mc "And I hope you understand why I'm doing it."
    mc "而且我希望你能理解我这么做的原因。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4175
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_bccb2290:

    # sa "You'll figure it out."
    sa "你会想明白的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4179
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_0ea6112e:

    # sa "I'm worried about tomorrow."
    sa "我担心明天的事。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4181
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_8b511035:

    # mc "You and me both. And probably the others too."
    mc "你我同感，说不定其他人也一样。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4182
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_335ac68e:

    # mc "Imagine not being able to trust your dad..."
    mc "想象一下，连爸爸都信不过……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4184
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_b2c892dd:

    # sa "Did you know about Maya's mom?"
    sa "你晓得Maya的妈妈吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4186
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_27dea9df:

    # mc "Yeah, Derek told me recently."
    mc "嗯，Derek最近告诉我的。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4188
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_6f4e8ccb:

    # sa "Maya told me about her a while back. And I could feel the pain in her words."
    sa "Maya之前跟我说起过她。我能听出她话里的痛苦。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4189
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_9683f4c9:

    # sa "I may not have either of my biological parents in my life, but based on what she told me, I believe she has it worse."
    sa "我这辈子可能连亲生父母都没有，但根据她跟我说的，我觉得她过得更糟。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4190
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_11c64f5a:

    # sa "To be forced to witness your mom suffer and deteriorate like that and be completely helpless."
    sa "被逼着看着你妈像那样痛苦地衰败下去，却什么都做不了。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4191
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_a92754f4:

    # sa "How do you even cope with it?"
    sa "你怎么应付这种事的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_bbq_events.rpy:4193
translate schinese ep10_bbq_s_event_label_f619370c:

